{"repositoryId":335227106,"availability":"available","full":"paganini2008/kookaburra","name":"kookaburra","description":"An embedded object database for Java 17+. You store plain annotated objects. Then you query them with a type-safe, chained API or with SQL-style OQL. Indexed filters, sorts and aggregates answer in milliseconds on millions of objects. Data is crash-safe on disk, with optional transactions, unique and foreign-key constraints and online backup. ","category":"Developer tools","language":"Java","stars":1,"forks":2,"created":"2021-02-02T08:59:08Z","updated":"2026-10-17T04:04:11Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://paganini2008.github.io/kookaburra/","topics":["bitmap","data-visualization","lsm-tree","object-database","roaringbitmap"],"demo":"https://paganini2008.github.io/kookaburra/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T18:18:12.551Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T18:18:12.551Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T18:18:12.551Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T18:18:12.551Z","stars":1,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Query Java objects like a database, right inside your application.","Kookaburra is an embedded object database for Java 17+. You store plain annotated objects. Then you query them with a type-safe, chained API (query(Book.class).where(Book::getYear).ge(1960).list()) or with SQL-style OQL. Indexed filters, sorts and aggregates answer in milliseconds on millions of objects. Data is crash-safe on disk, with optional transactions (READ COMMITTED, SNAPSHOT, SERIALIZABLE), unique and foreign-key constraints and online backup. Kookaburra Studio is a desktop admin tool for browsing, editing and querying any database.","🎬 Watch the tutorial (2:57, English subtitles) · MP4"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/paganini2008/kookaburra/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"63bd7965d9ceaef38fbe424d904954329300b28242807795a4bce8b1f6b6afb5","extractedAt":"2